# Second phrasing of each question in datacentre.chain (authored by the AI assistant, written before any router result was seen). DEV split. Router robustness probe only.
q1 | Which site did the board settle on for the data centre?
q2 | What's the money allocated to the data centre these days?
q3 | Is the data centre budget approved, on hold or revoked at the moment?
q4 | Who's got phase one of the build?
q5 | What's the target finish date for phase one?
q6 | On 30 April, was the data centre budget approved, on hold or revoked?
q7 | How much was the data centre budget as of 20 February?
