q9 | Which site were we going with on 1 March?
q10 | Who was running phase one on 1 April?
q11 | How many times did the budget's approval status flip?
q12 | How many revisions has the data centre budget amount had?
q13 | How many times did phase one's end date slip?
q14 | Going by the notes filed up to 20 February, what deadline did phase one have for 1 July?
